{"seq":1,"slug":"synthesis","title":"综合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/practice/synthesis","wordCount":1063,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"综合\">综合</h1><p>仿真通过只证明你的 Verilog「在仿真器里行为正确」，但它还不是电路。综合（synthesis）是把可综合的 RTL 翻译成由具体工艺库标准单元（与非门、触发器等）构成的门级网表的过程——这是软件世界里完全没有对应物的一步，也是 RTL 代码接受工具审判的第一道关卡。<a href=\"../foundations/why-hdl\">为什么需要硬件描述语言</a>里反复提到的「可综合子集」，到这里终于要兑现：写得不对的代码，综合工具要么报错，要么悄悄综合出你没想要的电路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>综合工具读入 RTL，经过三个大阶段产出网表：先做<strong>翻译</strong>（把 HDL 解析成与工艺无关的通用逻辑），再做<strong>逻辑优化</strong>（布尔化简、共享、删冗余），最后做<strong>工艺映射</strong>（把通用逻辑映射到目标库的真实单元，并在面积、速度、功耗间权衡）。整个过程受时序约束（时钟周期、输入输出延时）的驱动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[可综合 RTL] --&gt; B[翻译&lt;br/&gt;HDL 到通用逻辑]&#10;    B --&gt; C[逻辑优化&lt;br/&gt;化简/共享/删冗余]&#10;    C --&gt; D[工艺映射&lt;br/&gt;映射到标准单元库]&#10;    E[时序约束 SDC&lt;br/&gt;时钟/延时] --&gt; C&#10;    E --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; F[门级网表]&#10;    F --&gt; G[门级仿真 + STA 验证]\">flowchart TD\n    A[可综合 RTL] --&gt; B[翻译&lt;br/&gt;HDL 到通用逻辑]\n    B --&gt; C[逻辑优化&lt;br/&gt;化简/共享/删冗余]\n    C --&gt; D[工艺映射&lt;br/&gt;映射到标准单元库]\n    E[时序约束 SDC&lt;br/&gt;时钟/延时] --&gt; C\n    E --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; F[门级网表]\n    F --&gt; G[门级仿真 + STA 验证]</pre><p>下表区分综合工具对待 Verilog 各类结构的态度——这是写可综合代码的底线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Verilog 结构</th>\n<th>可综合</th>\n<th>综合结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>assign</code>、<code>always @(*)</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>组合逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>always @(posedge clk)</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>触发器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>for</code> 循环（边界为常量）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>展开成并行硬件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>initial</code> 块</td>\n<td>否（FPGA 部分支持）</td>\n<td>多被忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#</code> 延时</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>被忽略，可能致仿真综合不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>$display</code>、文件 I/O</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>被忽略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可综合代码的纪律\">可综合代码的纪律</h2><p>能否综合，取决于你是否守住了前面几章的建模纪律。组合 <code>always</code> 块必须覆盖全部分支否则产生意外锁存器（见<a href=\"../modeling/combinational-logic\">组合逻辑</a>），时序块必须用非阻塞赋值（见<a href=\"../modeling/sequential-logic\">时序逻辑</a>），<code>for</code> 循环边界必须是编译期常量才能被展开成固定硬件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 可综合：边界常量的 for 被展开成 8 个并行全加器&#10;genvar i;&#10;generate&#10;  for (i = 0; i &lt; 8; i = i + 1) begin : bit_slice&#10;    full_adder fa (.a(a[i]), .b(b[i]), .cin(c[i]),&#10;                   .sum(s[i]), .cout(c[i+1]));&#10;  end&#10;endgenerate\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 可综合：边界常量的 for 被展开成 8 个并行全加器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>genvar i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>generate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (i = 0; i &#x3C; 8; i = i + 1) begin : bit_slice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    full_adder fa (.a(a[i]), .b(b[i]), .cin(c[i]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                   .sum(s[i]), .cout(c[i+1]));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>endgenerate</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>generate</code>/<code>genvar</code> 是综合友好的「编译期循环」，它在综合前就把循环展开成固定数量的硬件实例，与运行时循环有本质区别。这种参数化展开依赖<a href=\"../foundations/modules-ports\">模块与端口</a>里的实例化与参数机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时序约束与时序收敛\">时序约束与时序收敛</h2><p>综合不是只追求逻辑正确，还要满足时序。工程师用约束文件（SDC）告诉工具时钟有多快、输入输出有多少延时预算，工具据此优化。综合后，静态时序分析（STA）检查每条寄存器到寄存器路径是否满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{clk} \\ge t_{cq} + t_{logic} + t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若某条路径太慢（建立时间违例），就需要优化逻辑、加流水级或放慢时钟，这个反复迭代直到全部路径达标的过程叫<strong>时序收敛</strong>。这条约束在<a href=\"../foundations/rtl-abstraction\">RTL 抽象层次</a>和<a href=\"../verification/simulation-timing\">仿真与时序</a>里都出现过，是贯穿设计始终的红线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"asic-与-fpga-综合的差异\">ASIC 与 FPGA 综合的差异</h2><p>综合的目标平台不同，工具和标准单元也不同。ASIC 综合把逻辑映射到代工厂提供的标准单元库；FPGA 综合则映射到芯片里固定的查找表（LUT）、触发器和专用块（如 DSP、BRAM）。下表概括差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ASIC 综合</th>\n<th>FPGA 综合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>映射目标</td>\n<td>工艺库标准单元</td>\n<td>LUT / FF / DSP / BRAM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表工具</td>\n<td>Synopsys DC、Cadence Genus</td>\n<td>Vivado、Quartus、Yosys（开源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复位策略</td>\n<td>倾向同步复位省面积</td>\n<td>看架构，FPGA 有专用复位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代成本</td>\n<td>极高（流片不可逆）</td>\n<td>低（可反复烧录）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>综合后必须再做一次门级仿真（带 SDF 反标延时）和 STA，确认在真实延时下功能与时序都正确。综合阶段最容易踩的坑——意外锁存器、组合环、综合仿真不一致——汇总在<a href=\"common-pitfalls\">常见陷阱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>综合把可综合 RTL 经翻译、逻辑优化、工艺映射三阶段变成门级网表，是软件没有对应物的关键一步。</li>\n<li>可综合性取决于建模纪律：覆盖全分支防锁存器、时序块用非阻塞、<code>for</code> 边界用常量。</li>\n<li><code>generate</code>/<code>genvar</code> 是编译期展开的循环，综合前就固化成固定数量的硬件实例。</li>\n<li>综合受时序约束驱动，综合后用 STA 检查 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{clk} \\ge t_{cq}+t_{logic}+t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，反复迭代实现时序收敛。</li>\n<li>ASIC 综合映射到工艺库标准单元，FPGA 综合映射到 LUT/FF/DSP；综合后必做门级仿真与 STA。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"综合","id":"综合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可综合代码的纪律","id":"可综合代码的纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"时序约束与时序收敛","id":"时序约束与时序收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"ASIC 与 FPGA 综合的差异","id":"asic-与-fpga-综合的差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"仿真与时序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/verification/simulation-timing"},"next":{"title":"有限状态机设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/practice/fsm-design"}}